{"id": "EUVD-2026-57824", "enisaUuid": "d62235c7-80fa-3665-91d3-5a18aa5ebb8e", "description": "GitPython before 3.1.57 fails to guard git option forwarding in IndexFile.checkout() and TagReference.create(), allowing attackers to pass unsafe options via kwargs. Attackers can use --prefix to overwrite arbitrary files with repository content or -F to read arbitrary files returned in-band.", "datePublished": "2026-08-13T11:28:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:24:41", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/gitpython-developers/GitPython/security/advisories/GHSA-3f7w-8rr8-f37f", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitpython-before-arbitrary-file-overwrite-and-read"], "aliases": ["PYSEC-2026-3949", "CVE-2026-73620", "GHSA-mhfq-f35q-x62m"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.57, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5b1ca0cc-0531-3fe4-97b7-368d35bd6a13", "product": {"name": "GitPython", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.1.57"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "680a260a-7e29-3168-8dbe-d33eb1050a8a", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}], "isExploited": false}